<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-WALES BEAT UNITED STATES 34-14.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-WALES BEAT UNITED STATES 34-14.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wales beat the United States 34-14 (halftime 17-9) in their international on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Wales - Tries: Ieuan Evans (2), Scott Gibbs, penalty try. Conversions: Arwel Thomas (4). Penalties: Thomas (2).</p>
<p>United States - Try: Andre Bachelet. Penalties: Matt Alexander (3).</p>
